Which of the following matrices are lower triangular matrices?

$$
A = \begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 0 \\ 0 & 0 & 1 \\ 0 & 0 & 0\end{bmatrix}
$$

$$
B = \begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 0 \\ 0 & 0 & 0 \\ 1 & 0 & 0\end{bmatrix}
$$

$$
C = \begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 1 \\ 0 & 0 & 0 \\ 1 & 0 & 1\end{bmatrix}
$$
